    "name":  "Linear LED Pendant Lamp 40W | POLARIS | Linear Interconnection | 3CCT | 120cm",
    "reference":  "LN40W-3CCT-92087",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e40W POLARIS 120CM LED Linear Pendant Lamp - CCT Selectable color temperature -\u003c/strong\u003e the ideal solution for elegant and efficient lighting.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts innovative \u003cstrong\u003einterconnectable design\u003c/strong\u003e allows connecting multiple lamps \u003cstrong\u003ein line\u003c/strong\u003e without additional accessories. \u003cstrong\u003eIncludes everything needed for suspended or surface mounting.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe ends of the batten allow continuous light passage\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eSuspended linear LED lamp 40W | POLARIS | Linear Interconnection | 3CCT | 120cm\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransform your spaces with the LED Linear Pendant Light 40W POLARIS 120CM, the ultimate solution for elegant, efficient, and versatile lighting. Designed to meet the most demanding needs of modern and professional environments, this light not only provides high-impact illumination but also ensures a quick and hassle-free installation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSelectable CCT Color Temperature:\u003c/strong\u003e Choose between 3000K, 4500K, and 6000K to create the perfect atmosphere, from warm and cozy to cool and bright.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContinuous Linear Interconnectable Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Multiple units can be connected in a seamless line without extra accessories, allowing full customization.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAccessory-Free Interconnection:\u003c/strong\u003e The lamps connect directly, ensuring a clean, modern installation with no visible cables.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContinuous Light Effect:\u003c/strong\u003e Designed to allow uninterrupted light flow, offering a refined, uniform visual appearance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLifud No Flick Driver:\u003c/strong\u003e Ensures flicker-free lighting for maximum comfort and long-term stability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUses and Applications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModern and Professional Environments:\u003c/strong\u003e The POLARIS LED Linear Pendant Light is perfect for modern offices, conference rooms, and other professional spaces requiring elegant and efficient lighting. Its sophisticated design complements any interior style, while its interconnectable functionality allows for custom configurations for different areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCommercial Spaces:\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal for stores, boutiques, and showrooms where high-impact lighting can enhance product presentation and improve the customer experience. Its ability to deliver continuous and uniform light helps create an attractive and professional environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExhibition Areas:\u003c/strong\u003e In museums, art galleries, and exhibitions, the POLARIS provides lighting that highlights artworks or products without creating shadows or interruptions. The continuous visual effect is particularly valuable in these environments to ensure attention remains on the exhibits.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResidential Applications:\u003c/strong\u003e Also an excellent choice for modern homes seeking high-quality lighting in spaces like living rooms, dining rooms, and kitchens. Its installation versatility and elegant design make it a valuable addition to any residential setting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGet the POLARIS LED Linear Pendant Light 40W 120CM and enjoy a lighting solution that combines style, efficiency, and ease of installation!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
